OL,3,GNEWSAGuests invited to stay in city's
OL,4,AWonky House
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council and Heritage
OL,7,FLincolnshire secured #350,000 for the
OL,8,Fproject from the Architectural Heritage
OL,9,FFund, with additional funding coming
OL,10,Ffrom a public appeal after deathwatch
OL,11,Fbeetle was found during the work.
OL,13,FTracy Stringfellow, chief executive of
OL,14,FHeritage Lincolnshire, said the 16th
OL,15,FCentury property, which was saved from
OL,16,Fdemolition in the 1930s, was "unique".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
